{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"熟悉的亲近忽然又变得真切，他身体先绷紧，随后才想起那种生活还没回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"身体先绷紧\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心只在心里怀念那种生活，因为当初不肯再等，就是怕珍惜的东西继续受损，光怀念护不住它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"光怀念护不住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想重新投入，却不敢毫无顾忌，怕自己又只顾硬撑，把刚找回的温柔磨掉，连想争取的心也没了。\",\n      \"key\": \"想争取的心\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他原以为想清为什么不能再等就能定下来，如今还得顾着别把温柔磨掉，反而拿不定主意。\",\n      \"key\": \"拿不定主意\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\", \"R33\", \"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\", \"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分重写\",\n      \"why\": \"S07-1保留真实安宁带来的熟悉亲近，以及现实未变时身体先受惊的反应。S07-2找回不甘心只在心里怀念的念头，明确当初不肯再等是怕珍惜之物继续受损，光怀念护不住它们。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R35\"],\n      \"now\": [],\n      \"what\": \"删除\",\n      \"why\": \"刚沉浸于满足并不是他的过错，自责没有带来新的心理原因，珠子也没有支持这种自我责备。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R36\", \"R37\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他想重新投入却无法毫无顾忌的变化，并明确写出他怕自己又只顾硬撑，磨掉刚找回的温柔，最后连想争取的心也失去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R38\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\", \"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"分散吸收，删除重复概括\",\n      \"why\": \"留下的风险由S07-2写明：光怀念护不住珍惜之物；向前的风险由S07-3写明：硬撑可能磨掉温柔。两边的具体理由已经成立，不必再用对称句重复一遍。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R39\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写保留\",\n      \"why\": \"保留原先以为找到不能再等的理由就能定下来的想法，也保留现在顾虑更多、反而难以决定的变化。把新增的顾虑落实为怕行动磨掉刚找回的温柔，并接回最初寻找足够理由的迟疑。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"这是对音乐材料身份的另一种听法，不必对应人物心理，也不能据此断言他重新站直或找回旧日自我。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7dc78787-27a3-45c2-bfe7-787c4165cf9c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T001914479929Z", "elapsed_seconds": 121.421, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:21:15.910360+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7eeb4679a655488e3480f2204592ef7e3f8cd374edc3f67c2edcbcef5c856eb6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T001914479929Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "30d28155fb93698d3abc313ce65bac701ce2c50ac17a515ca78dabe3629348b5"}}}
